<Article title="Recover your plan link" description="How to get your 8-week dead hang plan link back." h1="Lost your plan link?" crumbs={[{ name: 'Plan', href: '/plan/' }, { name: 'Lost link' }]} noindex>
<div class="article-body plan-page">
<ol>
<li>Search your inbox for the Stripe receipt sent when you paid. It carries a link back to your plan.</li>
<li>If you cannot find it, email <a href="mailto:hello@sunnypatel.co.uk">hello@sunnypatel.co.uk</a> from the address you paid with. Add the date you paid and the last four digits of the card.</li>
<li>I send the link back by hand, usually within a day.</li>
</ol>
<p class="small-copy">Your payment is covered by a 14-day refund. Ask by email in the same way.</p>
</div>
</Article>
